CS12698,pp.521-552,2021. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-77883-5_18 522 B. Libert et al. Technically, we realize BiAS from homomorphic commitments for a general family of predicates that can be represented by bounded-depth circuits.Ourconstructionisgenericandcanbeinstantiatedinthestan- dard model from lattices and, more efficiently, from bilinear maps. In particular, the signature length is independent of the circuit size when we use commitments with suitable efficiency properties. · · · ·"
        },
